    <!-- Guide / Help Content -->
    <string name="guide_content">
        Step-by-Step Guide\n
        1. Choose a Clear and Professional Profile Picture\n
        -Use a high-quality image of yourself or a professional logo.\n
        -Ensure the photo is well-lit and clearly shows your face if personal branding is involved.\n
        -Avoid blurry or low-resolution images.\n
        \n
        2. Write a Strong Headline\n
        -Make it short, descriptive, and highlight your key skill.\n
        Example: “Expert Graphic Designer | Logos and Branding Solutions”\n
        Pro Tips:\n
        -Focus on clarity and professionalism.\n
        -Use keywords that clients are likely to search for.\n
        -Be honest about your skills and delivery time.
    </string>
